(7687824, 1259079, 112739, '<td valign="top">Hey Mark, You have two separate and distinct images here. One with the smaller thumbnail where you can easily see the subjects/man''s face. You see details such as eyes and other facial features. Then when you view it at full size, it turns into a whole different image completely. I think the distinct horizontal transition line might be a creative choice or maybe an oversight in processing, but I don''t think it plays a huge role either way. I think your image is brilliant and is demonstrating to me at least, a business man who is seeking to have his soul revitalized with the natural wild world. In his minds eye, he sees what he yearns for the most. Great work. Should have ended higher for sure, IMO.</td>', 'Hey Mark, You have two separate and distinct images here. One with the smaller thumbnail where you can easily see the subjects/man''s face. You see details such as eyes and other facial features. Then when you view it at full size, it turns into a whole different image completely. I think the distinct horizontal transition line might be a creative choice or maybe an oversight in processing, but I don''t think it plays a huge role either way. I think your image is brilliant and is demonstrating to me at least, a business man who is seeking to have his soul revitalized with the natural wild world. In his minds eye, he sees what he yearns for the most. Great work. Should have ended higher for sure, IMO.', '2021-02-23 13:23:19.000000', NULL, 0),
